cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "cistron: genetic construct maps from a spreadsheet"
message: "If you use this software in a publication, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Teles
    given-names: Kaian
repository-code: "https://github.com/KaianTeles/cistron"
license: MIT
version: "1.0"
abstract: >-
  cistron draws genetic construct and cassette maps as editable SVG from an
  Excel workbook. Parts are described one row at a time; themes, labelling and
  colour are chosen in the spreadsheet rather than in code. Colour assignment
  is deterministic in the part label, so a gene keeps its colour across every
  figure in a set.
keywords:
  - synthetic biology
  - molecular biology
  - figure
  - visualization
  - SVG
  - plasmid map
